ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/202609220133329921_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/202609220133329921_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-21/6ab14a62e36b7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">打印穆里尼奥质疑判罚图！马竞官方晒视频嘲讽：停止对裁判的骚扰</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260921/202609212326134245.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260921/202609212326134245_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260921/202609212326134245_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">马竞官方社媒晒视频嘲讽穆里尼奥，视频里打印出的海报印有两行字：“立即停止对裁判的骚扰”。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-22/6ab16882e25fenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马竞再发文嘲讽皇马施压裁判：这个赛季他们开始得很早</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-22/6ab17bb6ca9d8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马竞回应：皇马再次越过红线 他们受益的误判用光森林也打印不完</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.97" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/202609220248168631.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.97" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.97" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/202609220248168631.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/202609220248168631.jpg"> </div><p>《马卡报》报道，马竞认为皇马方面关于裁判的言论已超过底线，而且他们也从判罚中受益很多。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-22/6ab1ae2b7d7d9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">西媒：马德里德比主裁将停哨2轮 CTA将审查李刚仁犯规</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/6ab1af0449584_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/6ab1af0449584_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/6ab1af0449584_720.jpg"> </div><p>科贝电台消息，马德里德比的裁判奥尔蒂斯·阿里亚斯将停哨2轮，裁判委员会将评估李刚仁等犯规。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-22/6ab177cae8a07native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英媒：英超向20队表示恩佐越位误判是重大失误，将进行全面审查</a></p><p>据《电讯报报道》，英超联赛在股东会议前致各俱乐部的信函中，重点提及了曼彻斯特德比中那次“重大”的VAR失误。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-22/6ab18028f1395native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">姆巴佩：我度过伟大一年，是最佳射手，这是金球奖最重要的标准</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.76" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/202609220306548804.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.76" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.76" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/202609220306548804.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/202609220306548804.jpg"> </div><p>姆巴佩接受RFI采访，再次谈到了金球奖话题，认为自己今年表现很好。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-22/6ab194ce750a6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">梅西社媒晒告别赛特别版球衣：最后一战…一件相伴一生的球衣❤️</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.02" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/202609220436233130.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.02" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.02" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/202609220436233130_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/202609220436233130_720.jpg"> </div><p>梅西在社媒晒出告别赛特别版球衣，并配文：“最后一战…一件相伴一生的球衣❤️”</p><p><strong>【其它新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-22/6ab19327c89efnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">贝林厄姆嘲讽罗梅罗：你跟梅西一起时话很多，在这里什么都不说了</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.52" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/202609220428471450.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.52" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.52" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/202609220428471450_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260922/202609220428471450_720.jpg"> </div><p>马德里德比中，贝林厄姆与罗梅罗发生过争执，转播方Movistar披露了两人争吵内容。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-21/6ab14e54384b7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">OPTA英超最新夺冠概率：阿森纳43.7%，曼城39.8%，利物浦5.7%</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260921/202609212334167635.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260921/202609212334167635.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260921/202609212334167635.jpg"> </div><p>OPTA对最新的英超夺冠概率进行了预测，阿森纳以43.7%居首，曼城上升至39.8%。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-21/6ab14a5ec91e7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">死敌！沙尔克04主场大屏幕展示德甲积分榜，将多特蒙德的字号调小</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.92" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260921/202609212317368110.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.92" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.92" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260921/202609212317368110.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260921/202609212317368110.jpg"> </div><p>据《图片报》报道称，沙尔克04在主场大屏幕展示的积分榜上，调小了多特蒙德的字号。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-21/6ab148301a703native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">每体：西甲跑动垫底+每场比巴萨少21公里 皇马需警惕比赛投入程度</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260921/6ab084e201ffe.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260921/6ab084e201ffe.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260921/6ab084e201ffe.jpg"> </div><p>《每日体育报》援引 Sofascore 统计的西甲跑动数据，分析了皇马在本项数据垫底的表现和可能产生的后果。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-21/6ab149b17a57dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">仅登场36分钟，迪奥曼德在德比战中过人数是维尼修斯、姆巴佩之和</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/6aa9bb1832593_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/6aa9bb1832593_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/6aa9bb1832593_720.jpg"> </div><p>皇马1-2不敌马竞，迪奥曼德的登场是为数不多的亮点之一。《阿斯报》对这名小将的表现进行了点评。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-21/6ab14ebb489f2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马尔基西奥：难以接受尤文球迷对默哀马佐拉的做法，他理应被尊重</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.72" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260921/202609212339561874.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260921/202609212339561874.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260921/202609212339561874.jpg"> </div><p>直播吧9月21日讯 在尤文对阵亚特兰大的赛前，部分尤文球迷拒不参加默哀马佐拉的仪式，背对球场并发起自己的口号，尤文名宿马尔基西奥在社交媒体发文批评了这些球迷。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-21/6ab14d6ba9495native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">曼联官方：舍什科因伤退出本期斯洛文尼亚国家队，将接受详细检查</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.3" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260109/6960ad763c036.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.3" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.3" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260109/6960ad763c036.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260109/6960ad763c036.jpg"> </div><p>曼联官方宣布前锋舍什科因伤退出本期斯洛文尼亚国家队，无缘即将到来的国际比赛日比赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-22/6ab16423371eenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">对阵贝蒂斯时锁骨骨折，记者：卡萨多将伤缺约3个月</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.52" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260921/202609210139513464.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.52" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.52" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260921/202609210139513464_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260921/202609210139513464_720.jpg"> <